    ## Visueel proces
    ```mermaid
    flowchart LR
      STOF1(["Meel"])
      STOF2(["Water"])
      STOF3(["Brood"])

      class STOF1,STOF2,STOF3 data;

      classDef data fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
      classDef emission fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;

      EP1(["Schouw 1"])
      EP2(["Lozingspunt 1"])

      class EP1,EP2 emission;

      PROCES1["Deeg maken"]
      PROCES2["Brood bakken"]

      STOF1 --> PROCES1
      STOF2 --> PROCES1
      PROCES1 --> PROCES2
      PROCES1 --> EP2
      PROCES2 --> EP1

      PROCES2 --> STOF3
    ```
    {% endmarkdown %}
  </section>
  <section>
    {% markdown %}
    ### Achterliggende data (1)
    ```mermaid
    flowchart LR
      STOF1(["**ProcesVariabele** <br> Meel"])
      STOF2(["**ProcesVariabele** <br> Water"])
      STOF3(["**ProcesVariabele** <br> Brood"])

      class STOF1,STOF2,STOF3,STOF4 data;

      classDef data fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
      classDef emission fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;

      EP1(["**Emissiepunt** <br> Schouw 1"])
      EP2(["**Emissiepunt** <br> Lozingspunt 1"])

      class EP1,EP2 emission;

      PROCES1["**Proces** <br> type=VERWERKING <br> benaming=Deeg maken"]
      PROCES2["**Proces** <br> type=VERWERKING <br> benaming=Brood bakken"]
    
      PROCES1 -->|"heeftInvoer"| STOF1
      PROCES1 -->|"heeftInvoer"| STOF2
      OVERBRENGING1["**Proces** <br> type=TRANSPORT"]
      PROCES1 --> OVERBRENGING1
      OVERBRENGING1 --> PROCES2
      EMISSIE1["**Proces** <br> type=EMISSIE"]
      EMISSIE2["**Proces** <br> type=EMISSIE"]
      PROCES1 --> EMISSIE1
      EMISSIE1 --> EP2
      PROCES2 --> EMISSIE2
      EMISSIE2 --> EP1

      PROCES2 -->|"heeftUitvoer"| STOF3
    ```
    {% endmarkdown %}
  </section>
